  2379	  # install normally hashes FMS_ROOT=$TARGET — on a rerun over an EDITED
  2380	  # delivered SPEC that would re-baseline the fork's bytes as framework-owned,
  2381	  # and a later uninstall would happily DELETE the user's modified tree (its
  2382	  # hash matches the manifest). Same C.5 idempotency posture upgrade.sh uses.
  2383	  #
